<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-3-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 3. As it is unlikely that you will quickly be able to assemble the full set, simming yourself is advised in order to optimize after taking into account the gear you get each raiding week.<br/>
<br/>Note that while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96934/lei-shens-orb-of-command">
<img alt="Lei Shen's Orb of Command" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_thunderisleraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lei Shen's Orb of Command</span></a> is the off-hand with the best stat combination from the raid, it is still worthwhile to go for a shield such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96808/tortos-discarded-shell">
<img alt="Tortos' Discarded Shell" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_thunderisleraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tortos' Discarded Shell</span></a> in order to reduce physical damage taken in the current raiding tier.<br/>
