<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Restoration Shamans in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our Phase 3 set 2-piece boosts <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=5394/healing-stream-totem">
